          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "But I can pay for them all",
          "rhyme": "ol",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "And by the model of my vehicle you know that I ball",
