        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "E92, but '91 the year that Tyler was spawned",
          "rhyme": "Ed",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "And if I crash, I'm owing wheels like I'm a Vaughn or a Vince, Tiptronic is stick",
          "rhyme": "ik",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Or automatic, you pick, shit is static as shit (Yeah)",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Sure, my shit is AM, might get that X6 end",
          "rhyme": "End",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Don't follow exit him, might take a back street hidden",
          "rhyme": "En",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "House got all sports cars like his garage is gym",
